flowchart TD
    START([evaluate flagKey, context]) --> FOUND{Flag exists in dataset?}
    FOUND -- no --> ERR1([ERROR: FLAG_NOT_FOUND])
    FOUND -- yes --> CYC{Cycle guard seen set?}
    CYC -- yes --> ERR2([ERROR: MALFORMED_FLAG])
    CYC -- no --> PRE{All prerequisites on & matching?}
    PRE -- no --> OFF1([offVariation: PREREQUISITE_FAILED])
    PRE -- yes --> KILL{flag.on == true?}
    KILL -- no --> OFF2([offVariation: OFF])
    KILL -- yes --> TGT{Exact target match?}
    TGT -- yes --> RES1([TARGET_MATCH])
    TGT -- no --> RULE{First rule where all clauses match?}
    RULE -- yes --> VR([RULE_MATCH: variation or sticky rollout])
    RULE -- no --> FT([FALLTHROUGH: variation or sticky rollout])
